[5343]={name="Barov Family Fortune",level=60,req=52,xp=6600,side="A",start={k="npc",n="Weldon Barov",m=1422,x=43.5,y=83.7},finish={k="npc",n="Weldon Barov",m=1422,x=43.5,y=83.7},text="Venture to the Scholomance and recover the Barov family fortune. Four deeds make up this fortune: The Deed to Caer Darrow; The Deed to Brill; The Deed to Tarren Mill; and The Deed to Southshore. Return to Weldon Barov when you have completed this task."},
[5382]={name="Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher",level=60,req=55,xp=6600,side="B",start={k="npc",n="Eva Sarkhoff",m=1422,x=70.2,y=73.7},finish={k="npc",n="Eva Sarkhoff",m=1422,x=70.2,y=73.7},text="Find Doctor Theolen Krastinov inside the Scholomance. Destroy him, then burn the Remains of Eva Sarkhoff and the Remains of Lucien Sarkhoff. Return to Eva Sarkhoff when the task is complete. "},
